  "slug": "apple-smoothie-recipe-7568869",
  "name": "Apple Smoothie",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "This apple smoothie works well with any kind of apple\u2014sweet, tart, or anything in between. With warm pie spices, Greek yogurt, banana, and almond butter, it's a great way to begin your day or liven up the afternoon.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place banana, apple, yogurt, apple juice, oats, almond butter, maple syrup, cinnamon, nutmeg, and cloves into the cup of a high speed blender, and blend until smooth. If desired, add ice for a thicker smoothie, or add milk for a thinner consistency."
    }
  ],
